        <a href="https://github.com/ashmitbohora">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="wrap hero">
      <p class="kicker">Austin, TX · UT Austin <b>Statistics &amp; Data Science</b> · Class of 2029</p>
      <h1>Full-stack. <span class="lit">Literally.</span></h1>
      <p class="dek">
        I'm <b>Ashmit Bohora</b> — I ship real products: a live guitar-learning app,
        28 client websites built solo, and the analytics pipeline behind a 6K-follower
        food brand. Looking for Summer 2027 internships in data science, software
        engineering, or AI.
      </p>
