          <div class="nf-row"><span class="k">TypeScript / React <small>327-file app, live</small></span><span class="v"><b>CLEAN</b> · 4/5</span></div>
          <div class="nf-row"><span class="k">SQL <small>Postgres in prod, quality checks</small></span><span class="v">DECENT · 3/5</span></div>
          <div class="nf-row sub"><span class="k">R <small>coursework — tidyverse next</small></span><span class="v">TRYING · 2/5</span></div>
          <div class="nf-row sub"><span class="k">ML / Modeling <small>recommender shipped; classical ML next</small></span><span class="v">TRYING · 2/5</span></div>
          <div class="nf-foot">* Scale from my own app, PickMyPath: LOST → TRYING → DECENT → <b>CLEAN</b> → PERFECT. Nothing here is PERFECT yet. That's the roadmap, not a weakness.</div>
